<title>USA: Intermagnetics, Sumitomo broaden ties.</title>
<headline>Intermagnetics, Sumitomo broaden ties.</headline>
<dateline>LATHAM, N.Y. 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Intermagnetics General Corp and Japan's Sumitomo Corp of America said on Friday they have broadened their collaboration, giving Sumitomo warrants  to buy up to 1.2 million shares of Intermagnetics common stock.</p>
<p>The warrant agreement also specifies that Sumitomo's U.S. subsidiary and Intermagnetics will examine marketing activties and collaborate in the Asia Pacific areas, the companies said in a joint statement.</p>
</text>
